/A 1416 0 R
/Alt (Scientific figure composed of multiple panels: Panel A shows a dot plot comparing anti-SITH-1 antibody titers between NCs and PASC groups with significantly higher titers in PASC; Panel B displays a receiver operating characteristic \(ROC\) curve; Panel C presents anti-SITH-1 antibody titers across Wild Type, Alpha, Delta, and Omicron SARS-CoV-2 variants; Panel D comprises six dot plots showing relationships between anti-SITH-1 antibody presence and indices for fatigue, depression, brain fog, cough, hair loss, and dysosmia, with statistical significance indicated for some symptoms.)
