/A 1421 0 R
/Alt (Figure with experimental timeline diagrams, bar graphs, and microscopy images. Panels A and D show schematic representations of adenoviral constructs and intranasal inoculation in mice, distinguishing S1/Adv from Vector/Adv, and SITH-1/Adv from Control/Adv groups. Panels B, C, F, and G display scatter plots comparing molecular expression levels or cell counts between groups, with asterisks marking significant differences. Panel E presents immunofluorescence images of basal forebrain sections, highlighting ChAT-positive cells, with dashed boundaries indicating the medial septum \(MS\) and the diagonal band of Broca \(DBB\) in control and SITH-1-treated samples. All axes, group labels, and markers are clearly labeled for each panel.)
